<title>USA: Mitchell sets $283 mln 98 capital budget.</title>
<headline>Mitchell sets $283 mln 98 capital budget.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitchell Energy &amp; Development Corp said on Tuesday it set a $283 million capital budget for fiscal 1998, up 20 percent from the $235 million in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The 1998 budget includes $165 million for exploration and production, $75 million for real estate, $37 million for natural gas services and $6 million for corporate outlays.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
